    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcbc <i>From Lab Rat to Kingpin</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just playing the game. You <i>are</i> the game.<br>Start with nothing, an empty room, a burner phone, and a head full of ambition. Cook your first batch, sell on the streets, and claw your way up the criminal food chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/95dc994655d288f3eb8240400cacba56.poster.avif?t=1753126308\" width=598 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/95dc994655d288f3eb8240400cacba56.webm?t=1753126308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/95dc994655d288f3eb8240400cacba56.mp4?t=1753126308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea <i>Legal? Illegal? Doesn\u2019t Matter.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make clean meds or dirty drugs. Design your own chemical recipes using a deep crafting system. Create high-demand designer substances or flood the market with cheap junk, what you cook is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/3265b2e0c41c1c205f933aa69a1d5965.poster.avif?t=1753126308\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/3265b2e0c41c1c205f933aa69a1d5965.webm?t=1753126308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/3265b2e0c41c1c205f933aa69a1d5965.mp4?t=1753126308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude94 <i>Stay Ahead or Go Down Hard</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupt cops, rival gangs, snitches, and undercover agents, everyone wants a piece. Manage your heat, cover your tracks, and always have an escape plan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <i>Solo Hustler or Co-op Cartel</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone, or build an empire with your crew in seamless 2\u20134 player online co-op. Share labs, split profits, or double-cross them when it\u2019s time to take it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2b <i>Run the Streets. Rule the City.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your operation, hire dealers, set up fronts, and take over neighborhoods. Launder your money through clubs, clinics, or crooked businesses. But be warned: the bigger you get, the more heat you\u2019ll attract.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <i>Your Empire. Your Rules.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. No fake choices. You decide how far you\u2019ll go, and what kind of kingpin you want to be. Build, betray, cook, kill, and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The streets don\u2019t forgive. The empire won\u2019t build itself.</strong><br><strong>Time to rise.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcbc <i>From Lab Rat to Kingpin</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just playing the game. You <i>are</i> the game.<br>Start with nothing, an empty room, a burner phone, and a head full of ambition. Cook your first batch, sell on the streets, and claw your way up the criminal food chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/95dc994655d288f3eb8240400cacba56.poster.avif?t=1753126308\" width=598 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/95dc994655d288f3eb8240400cacba56.webm?t=1753126308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/95dc994655d288f3eb8240400cacba56.mp4?t=1753126308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea <i>Legal? Illegal? Doesn\u2019t Matter.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make clean meds or dirty drugs. Design your own chemical recipes using a deep crafting system. Create high-demand designer substances or flood the market with cheap junk, what you cook is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/3265b2e0c41c1c205f933aa69a1d5965.poster.avif?t=1753126308\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/3265b2e0c41c1c205f933aa69a1d5965.webm?t=1753126308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/3265b2e0c41c1c205f933aa69a1d5965.mp4?t=1753126308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude94 <i>Stay Ahead or Go Down Hard</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupt cops, rival gangs, snitches, and undercover agents, everyone wants a piece. Manage your heat, cover your tracks, and always have an escape plan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <i>Solo Hustler or Co-op Cartel</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone, or build an empire with your crew in seamless 2\u20134 player online co-op. Share labs, split profits, or double-cross them when it\u2019s time to take it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2b <i>Run the Streets. Rule the City.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your operation, hire dealers, set up fronts, and take over neighborhoods. Launder your money through clubs, clinics, or crooked businesses. But be warned: the bigger you get, the more heat you\u2019ll attract.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <i>Your Empire. Your Rules.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. No fake choices. You decide how far you\u2019ll go, and what kind of kingpin you want to be. Build, betray, cook, kill, and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The streets don\u2019t forgive. The empire won\u2019t build itself.</strong><br><strong>Time to rise.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Build your empire! Cook and make illegal drugs, expand your cartel, and outsmart rivals and law enforcement. Play solo or team up in co-op to dominate the underworld! Your empire, your rules. Rise to power! Don't get high on your own dope!",
